            "sid": "2SA 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo inko shonse isha bena Israeli shaishile kuli Davidi ku Hebuloni no kumweba ati, “Ifwe tuli munofu obe kabili umulopa obe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu nshita shapita, ilyo Saulo ali imfumu pali ifwe, iwe niwe waletungulula Israeli mu bulwi bwabo. Kabili Yawe atile kuli iwe, ‘Iwe uli nokucema abantu bandi abena Israeli, kabili ukaba kateeka wabo.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo abakalamba ba bena Israeli bonse baishile kuli Davidi ku Hebuloni, imfumu nayo epakucita icipangano nabo ku Hebuloni pa cinso cakwa Yawe. Elyo basuba Davidi amafuta yakuba imfumu ya bena Israeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
