        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi Davidi epakwipusha Yawe, nao ayasuka ati, “Wibalungama pakunina pamulu, lelo ushinguluke ku numa yabo no kubasanshila ku ntanshi ya fimuti fya basamu.",
